H3 keeps getting faster. ⚡️

@sgl_project + VDN-H3 now push MiniMax H3 beyond 2× real-time denoising on 8× B200 - generating 14.4s of 768p video in 9.0s end-to-end after warmup, with no measured quality regression.

Open models compound through open ecosystems. 🚀

Honoured to receive the Albert Medal from
@theRSAorg! Science & tech enable amazing opportunities, but the arts & humanities will be crucial in shaping what sort of future we want to see as a society in the coming AGI era. Fun discussion w/
@FryRsquared covering many new topics: https://t.co/Pmf73lyak8
